# Project: Multi-repo (spiderFeet + spiderFeet-widget)

## Roots

| Root | Repo | Role |
|------|------|------|
| `spiderFeet` | `brettforbes/spiderFeet` | Python backend, FastAPI, TypeDB, modules |
| `spiderFeet-widget` | `brettforbes/spiderFeet-widget` | iFrame UI (Bootstrap 5, D3, webpack) |

Open both via `.seed/spiderFeet_complete.code-workspace`.

## Rules

- Each root has **independent** `.cursor/rules/`; project rules are root-specific
- Cross-reference files with root prefix: `@spiderFeet/.docs/...`, `@spiderFeet-widget/src/...`
- FastAPI must expose CORS and stable base URL for widget consumption (stage 2+)
- Widget never embeds TypeDB credentials; connection flows through backend APIs (stage 3+)
- GitHub epics/issues may span repos; link related issues in issue bodies

## Skill

Read `.cursor/skills/cursor-multi-repo/SKILL.md` before cross-root tasks.
